<title>UK: Unilever sells John West Foods to Heinz.</title>
<headline>Unilever sells John West Foods to Heinz.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-Dutch conglomerate Unilever Plc said on Monday it had sold its John West Foods business to H.J. Heinz Co for an undisclosed sum.  </p>
<p>It said the consideration was not significant in relation to Unilever's assets. John West, a canned foods firm, has sales of 150 million stg last year and employs 88 people.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
